2026-07-27T10:00:56.6801733Z i /tmp/RtmpMxw1g0/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:00:56.6802076Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:00:56.6802472Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:00:56.6802831Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:00:56.6803377Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:00:56.6804177Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:00:56.6805105Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
